        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                         <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/a8024cf9125215906980610cc551fb46.avif?t=1770259431\" width=339 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Royal Jest</strong> is the world's first ever theatrically performed<strong> </strong>game! <strong>Play</strong> as our hero, a humble peasant boy, as he receives a once-in-a-lifetime invitation to the opulent royal palace. The royal family, eager to refresh their incestuous lineage, seeks a worthy suitor for the Princess...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted with charming, hand-cut papercraft aesthetics, this unique adventure blends <strong>dark humor</strong>, stage-inspired gameplay, and theatrical set pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/64f0867726730939e8737347fa63535c.poster.avif?t=1770259431\" width=569 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/64f0867726730939e8737347fa63535c.webm?t=1770259431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features: </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bizarre and eccentric characters and animations!</strong> Encounter a wild cast of quirky characters brought to life with vibrant, offbeat animations that burst with personality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A never ending barrage of fully scripted humor!</strong> Dive into a relentless stream of witty dialogue and absurd situations that keep the laughs coming from start to finish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of theatrical set pieces to discover and explore!</strong> Uncover a variety of dynamic, stage-inspired environments filled with  hidden surprises waiting to be explored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An upbeat original soundtrack!</strong> Groove to a lively, custom-composed soundtrack that perfectly complements the game’s theatrical vibe!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>…and fully player controlled curtains!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/11b11014bf7b1247e21a7b1ffa754651.poster.avif?t=1770259431\" width=608 height=377 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/11b11014bf7b1247e21a7b1ffa754651.webm?t=1770259431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starring <strong>Tony</strong>, the flamboyant knight who slays with style and a wink, all while dodging questions about his private life...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/f24f6de812c95fbc74e195e101e07c8e.poster.avif?t=1770259431\" width=666 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/f24f6de812c95fbc74e195e101e07c8e.webm?t=1770259431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…facing off all manner of walking <strong>clichés</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/eaadf49950a637409480604713de4361.poster.avif?t=1770259431\" width=604 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/eaadf49950a637409480604713de4361.webm?t=1770259431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It ain't curtains till the <strong>fat lady</strong> belches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                         <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/a8024cf9125215906980610cc551fb46.avif?t=1770259431\" width=339 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Royal Jest</strong> is the world's first ever theatrically performed<strong> </strong>game! <strong>Play</strong> as our hero, a humble peasant boy, as he receives a once-in-a-lifetime invitation to the opulent royal palace. The royal family, eager to refresh their incestuous lineage, seeks a worthy suitor for the Princess...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted with charming, hand-cut papercraft aesthetics, this unique adventure blends <strong>dark humor</strong>, stage-inspired gameplay, and theatrical set pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/64f0867726730939e8737347fa63535c.poster.avif?t=1770259431\" width=569 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/64f0867726730939e8737347fa63535c.webm?t=1770259431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features: </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bizarre and eccentric characters and animations!</strong> Encounter a wild cast of quirky characters brought to life with vibrant, offbeat animations that burst with personality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A never ending barrage of fully scripted humor!</strong> Dive into a relentless stream of witty dialogue and absurd situations that keep the laughs coming from start to finish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of theatrical set pieces to discover and explore!</strong> Uncover a variety of dynamic, stage-inspired environments filled with  hidden surprises waiting to be explored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An upbeat original soundtrack!</strong> Groove to a lively, custom-composed soundtrack that perfectly complements the game’s theatrical vibe!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>…and fully player controlled curtains!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/11b11014bf7b1247e21a7b1ffa754651.poster.avif?t=1770259431\" width=608 height=377 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/11b11014bf7b1247e21a7b1ffa754651.webm?t=1770259431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starring <strong>Tony</strong>, the flamboyant knight who slays with style and a wink, all while dodging questions about his private life...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/f24f6de812c95fbc74e195e101e07c8e.poster.avif?t=1770259431\" width=666 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/f24f6de812c95fbc74e195e101e07c8e.webm?t=1770259431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >…facing off all manner of walking <strong>clichés</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/eaadf49950a637409480604713de4361.poster.avif?t=1770259431\" width=604 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854960/extras/eaadf49950a637409480604713de4361.webm?t=1770259431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It ain't curtains till the <strong>fat lady</strong> belches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
